  there are hundreds, they change every week, and a sitemap that goes stale is
  worse than one that is short. They are reachable from /players, which is
  listed, and that is how a crawler is meant to find them.

  changefreq and priority are hints a search engine is free to ignore, and
  Google says it ignores both. They are here because the other engines that
  send traffic have not said so.
-->
